            "review_text": "Voyage01812012859\n1 contribution\n0\nAggressively mediocre\nApr 2025 • Couples\nI have had hot pot a few dozen times in Ho Chi Minh in the last year.\n\nThis is the only place I have ever been disappointed in. \n\nThe hot pot was without a doubt the worst I have ever had. \n\nI was hesitanting to call it bad l, since it was offensive, but after paying about 1.5 million for 2 people neither of us wanted to finish it just because we could get better food anywhere else for less in this city.\n\nThe issue wasn't the price, I regularly pay 500k for a meal for myself. The food was just aggressive mediocre.\n\nThe long wait and price just make it worse.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 6, 2025",
