            "review_text": "Robyn M\nMelbourne, Australia90 contributions\n0\nCrazy busy and fun\nSep 2023 • Friends\nLoads of people in HCMC had a birthday on the day we went for lunch so “Happy Birthday” was the song of the day. The restaurant was really full and everyone was having fun, including the 3 of us. \nWe have eaten hotpot before but not like this. 4 different soups to cook the meat and vegetables in (with a choice of others). The food was really fresh and the choice of additions and sauces was extensive. \nFree nails and free dessert we did not take advantage of but might next time!!\nGlad they have branches in Melbourne so that we can eat it here as well.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 9, 2023",
