            "review_title": "Review at Haidilao",
            "review_text": "Leessuhhh\n18 contributions\n0\nYummy in my tummy!\nNov 2019 • Couples\nThe hotpot here is delicious! Not vietnamese cuisine but definitely a nice treat if you want something outside the delicious Vietnamese food. \n\nLocated on the second floor of the Bitexco building. My boyfriend and I visited the restaurant around 7pm and waited approximately 2 hours. They will mention that it is a half hour wait but it’s really not. While waiting, they do service fruits, water, and even have a manicure service station for free! \n\nThe food here is good. It’s your typical hotpot restaurant where you can choose 1 or 2 soups depending on your party. We opted for the tomato base and Tom yum base. Both very hearty and satisfying. After that, you choose the toppings such as vegetables, meat, and all other toppings. The restaurant does have a mini salad bar, dessert options and sauce station. Expect to spend about 800,000 VND here, but well worth it.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 25, 2019",
